<header class="report-header">
  <h1>Greeter takes a Name value object</h1>
  <p class="target">fixture</p>
  <p class="coverage">12 of 14 changed lines shown in chapters (86%). Reader pass: 1 round, 2 questions answered, none open.</p>
  <details class="excluded"><summary>Excluded from the count: 3 files</summary><ul><li>docs/new näme.md <span class="muted">docs: prose, not code</span></li><li>img/logo.png <span class="muted">binary</span></li><li>img/photo.jpg <span class="muted">binary</span></li></ul></details>
